  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2fabfc503d1abde4ab2527103056f87a, type: 3}
  m_Name: NPC Orlan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  lines:
  - "Ng\u01B0\u01A1i c\xF3 ti\u1EC1m n\u0103ng \u0111\u1EA5y, th\u1EADm ch\xED c\xF2n
    nhanh h\u01A1n t\xEAn th\u1EED th\xE1ch tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
  - "\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1EA3nh tinh th\u1EA7n, tuy nhi\xEAn \u0111\u1EC3 c\xF3
    th\u1EC3 ph\xE1t huy s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh phong \u1EA5n, c\u1EA7n c\xF3 th\xEAm
    m\u1EA3nh s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh."
  - "S\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EE7a 2 m\u1EA3nh l\xE0 qu\xE1 l\u1EDBn v\xEC v\u1EADy
    ch\xFAng kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE9p \u1EDF c\u1EA1nh nhau, ch\u1EC9
    c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF3 d\xF2ng m\xE1u \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t m\u1EDBi c\xF3
    th\u1EC3 k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p ch\xFAng l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EC3 phong \u1EA5n qu\xE1i
    v\u1EADt."
  - "Ta s\u1EBD d\u1EABn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng cho ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111\u1EBFn v\u1ECB
    tr\xED c\u1EE7a Sett, k\u1EBB \u0111\xF3 hi\u1EC7n \u0111ang n\u1EAFm gi\u1EEF
    m\u1EA3nh s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh. "
  - "H\xE3y b\u1EA3o tr\u1ECDng, n\u01A1i \u0111\xF3 kh\xF4ng d\u1EC5 d\xE0ng nh\u01B0
    \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y \u0111\xE2u."
  dialogueLines: []
